#. js-lingui-explicit-id
msgid "{NAME_APP} offers premium features through subscription plans. Subscriptions are managed through the App Store, Google Play Store, and RevenueCat. Payment processing is handled by the respective app stores. Subscription fees are non-refundable except as required by law or app store policies. Users may manage their subscriptions through their app store account settings."
